{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_5_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"一、五年，春，公觀魚於棠。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"傳曰：常事曰視，非常曰觀。禮，尊不親小事，卑不尸大功。魚，卑者之事也，公觀之非正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，葬衞桓公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"月葬，故也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"三、秋，衞師入郕。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"入者，內弗受也。郕，國也。將卑師眾曰師。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"四、九月，考仲子之宮。初獻六羽。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"考者何也？考者成之也，成之為夫人也。禮，庶子為君，為其母築宮，使公子主其祭也。於子祭，於孫止。仲子者，惠公之母，隱孫而修之，非隱也。初，始也。穀梁子曰：「舞夏，天子八佾，諸公六佾，諸侯四佾。初獻六羽，始僭樂矣。」尸子曰：「舞夏，自天子至諸侯，皆用八佾。初獻六羽，始厲樂矣。」","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"五、邾人、鄭人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"六、螟。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"蟲災也。甚則月，不甚則時。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月，辛巳，公子彄卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"隱不爵命大夫，其曰公子彄，何也？先君之大夫也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"八、宋人伐鄭，圍長葛。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_5_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_5","textTraditional":"伐國不言圍邑，此其言圍何也？久之也。伐不踰時，戰不逐奔，誅不填服。苞人民、毆牛馬曰侵。斬樹木、壞宮室曰伐。","sentenceOrder":15}],"overrides":{}}